{"entries":[{"id":"arvindnarayanan-steering-ai-beyond-automation","sourceId":"arvindnarayanan","sourceName":"阿尔温德·纳拉亚南 · AI as Normal Technology","title":"Steering AI Beyond Automation","titleZh":"引导人工智能超越自动化","published":"2026-10-14T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1791936000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/arvindnarayanan-steering-ai-beyond-automation/","image":"","summary":"The dominant Silicon Valley AI agenda narrowly targets labor automation, while human-AI collaboration remains underdeveloped; the authors propose a tentative research program for collaborative AI and a bottom-up, market-driven approach to steer its development.","summaryZh":"硅谷主流人工智能议程狭隘地聚焦于劳动自动化，而人机协作方向仍发展不足；作者提出一个协作式人工智能的初步研究纲领，以及一种自下而上、市场驱动的引导其发展的路径。"},{"id":"arvindnarayanan-a-big-tent-or-small-tent-ai-safety","sourceId":"arvindnarayanan","sourceName":"阿尔温德·纳拉亚南 · AI as Normal Technology","title":"A big-tent or small-tent AI safety movement?","titleZh":"AI 安全运动：大帐篷还是小帐篷？","published":"2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1790812800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/arvindnarayanan-a-big-tent-or-small-tent-ai-safety/","image":"","summary":"The dominance of the existential-risk framing in AI safety is counterproductive; efforts should instead target concrete, evidence-based catastrophic risks.","summaryZh":"存在性风险叙事主导 AI 安全讨论反而有害，应转而聚焦具体、有证据支撑的灾难性风险。"},{"id":"arvindnarayanan-p-doom","sourceId":"arvindnarayanan","sourceName":"阿尔温德·纳拉亚南 · AI as Normal Technology","title":"AI existential risk probabilities are (still) too unreliable to inform policy","titleZh":"AI 存在性风险概率（仍然）过于不可靠，无法为政策提供依据","published":"2026-09-28T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1790553600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/arvindnarayanan-p-doom/","image":"","summary":"Quantitative estimates of AI existential risk (p(doom)) lack validated models or methods and are too unreliable to serve as a legitimate basis for public policy.","summaryZh":"AI 存在性风险的量化估计（p（doom））缺乏经过验证的模型或方法，过于不可靠，无法成为公共政策的正当依据。"},{"id":"arvindnarayanan-the-ai-as-normal-technology-view","sourceId":"arvindnarayanan","sourceName":"阿尔温德·纳拉亚南 · AI as Normal Technology","title":"The AI-as-Normal-Technology view of loss of control incidents","titleZh":"以 AI 为常态技术的失控事件观","published":"2026-09-14T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1789344000000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/arvindnarayanan-the-ai-as-normal-technology-view/","image":"","summary":"The essay argues that AI control—external safeguards like sandboxing and monitoring—is an unsolved problem requiring sustained investment and corporate accountability, not just alignment, to keep pace with advancing agent capabilities.","summaryZh":"该文认为，AI 控制——沙箱、监控等模型外部干预——是一个尚未解决的问题，需要持续投入与企业问责，而不仅是价值对齐，才能跟上智能体能力的进步。"},{"id":"arvindnarayanan-ai-as-normal-technology","sourceId":"arvindnarayanan","sourceName":"阿尔温德·纳拉亚南 · Princeton","title":"AI as Normal Technology","titleZh":"AI 作为正常技术","published":"2025-04-01T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1743465600000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/arvindnarayanan-ai-as-normal-technology/","image":"","summary":"AI should be viewed as a normal technology, not as a magical or exceptional force.","summaryZh":"AI 应被视为一种正常技术，而非神奇或特殊的力量。"}]}